2. OWASP Threat Model Cookbook
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   https://github.com/OWASP/threat-model-cookbook
   Copyright (c) The OWASP Foundation.
   That project licenses its models as text or graphics under Creative
   Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), and its models as code
   under the Apache License, Version 2.0. CC BY 4.0 asks for attribution and
   adds no ShareAlike condition.

   Four evaluation cases are prose conversions of Cookbook models:

     evals/corpus/05-cookbook-queue-webapp/    from a Threat Dragon model
     evals/corpus/06-cookbook-online-game/     from a pytm model (code)
     evals/corpus/09-cookbook-sokify-retail/   from a Threat Dragon model
     evals/corpus/10-cookbook-generic-cms/     from a pytm model (code)

   Both Cookbook licences ask for attribution and permit an adaptation under
   other terms, so these cases carry the Apache License with the attribution
   preserved. Each case names its exact source model in the `provenance` field
   of its case.json.

   Changes made: each diagram or model file is rewritten as the semi-structured
   prose a user of this service would submit. The threat annotations some source
   models carry are deliberately not copied.
